/*
** Density.
**
** This used to override `.tc-tiddler-frame` and `.tc-story-river` directly with
** hard-coded px and `!important` on both. It now re-points the two density
** tokens instead, so every record, gutter, info panel and fold banner follows
** from one switch — and nothing needs `!important`, because this stylesheet
** loads after variables.tid (which is pinned first by its `list-before` field)
** and simply re-declares the custom properties on the same :root.
*/

{{{ [[$:/config/themes/workbench/density]get[text]match[comfortable]then[:root{--w-row-y:var(--w-space-lg);--w-row-x:var(--w-space-lg);}]] }}}
